nd{aligned}\n$$\n\n- The matrix $W$ is not an elementary matrix because it can't be obtained from ${I}_{2}$ by applying only one elementary row operation.\n\n- The matrix $E$ is an elementary matrix because it can be obtained from ${I}_{2}$ by applying the elementary row operation ${R}_{1}:={R}_{1}+(-4){R}_{2},$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{I}_{2} & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}] &  & {R}_{1}:={R}_{1}+(-4){R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =E\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, only $Q$ and $E$ are elementary matrices." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-42751/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "853a04b2-591a-51c2-b80f-73f559355d9f"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-42751"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-130778/selection/65ba8819f3e58faf7f38a4d6322aef37c6cf3ebb9a278913bd45b9674be4b54d" :answer/id #uuid "05a6a4bc-86d5-5b80-98f4-d19e3099ae51" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$C$  only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130778/selection/079b225026cc487a3bb0bac2ee7c5b5b314833eaf494b2da250f7de9db27a2e5" :answer/id #uuid "c5a8d076-21a2-59eb-8e3f-f57d1fb5c3a1" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$A$  only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130778/selection/bec67fc59832fc3ca45a7c7611f69691068c79dbb6b693aec17ff2660f36490d" :answer/id #uuid "0b5da5f7-8432-5cf7-9b6e-3820a1e1265b" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$A$  and $C$ only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130778/selection/7971cb05d624f73d5b756a144817f9d76bf317f9b635f60961c07021d38185c3" :answer/id #uuid "f5c11f18-f9f6-562f-8d27-b02995ffbac2" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$A$  and $B$ only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130778/selection/a5c92681e90a059a1f14ff8cb6c5effaecb929ee088b17e5d8e66a13154bddef" :answer/id #uuid "e13f934e-1975-5d9d-b6af-ff11e1a58dd6" :answer/type :