R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & \\frac{1}{2} & 1\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe inverse is obtained on the right-hand side of our big matrix after the transformation. Therefore, \n\n$$\n{A}^{-1}=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ \\frac{1}{2} & 1\\end{aligned}].\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-130796/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "6c56b3e9-cf23-5e1e-8c7d-c474059c9a9d"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-130796"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-73642/selection/42f04e9de0efd304e877c04bab16157a31e8aa61e47b91686fa34a4a638b8acc" :answer/id #uuid "f2d402a0-6f02-5cb4-a96e-c49350a16dfe" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{2}{3} & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73642/selection/09175c11ef1a1c7fb9ca142b97c34500198e260c0ca3bff478177136699920ac" :answer/id #uuid "34ea6a7f-d5a6-5d0d-bcf8-d1676464e907" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{3}{2} & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73642/selection/e0d549ab78b8593afe62a6ba49eacca97572b275cacc5c1992febb3fa458664a" :answer/id #uuid "9ae9d727-cd0c-591f-8c90-f2d50c572b8a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-\\frac{2}{3} & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73642/selection/01623904437f6c1bd2e05cfc7ca6747743318cc5d70daa546ab00fad2870daab" :answer/id #uuid "bc7576c8-5728-59bb-81c9-27e48af59544" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -\\frac{2}{3}\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73642/selection/50504c87d98dde6ee6b5dc9a1af5453ff5d99303c8e86f166a5e1ad53ab33064" :answer/id #uuid "cbede3d1-c1ce-5549-91b0-2897e090e1f7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & \\frac{2}{3}\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:a